                "summary": "Correctness review of dcaceca: no path deletes without the typed name. Pointer and Enter/Space both go through heldButton.start -> allowed(), which refuses with the German line while named() is false (src/caregiver.ts:3074-3081); the act re-checks named() at release (3126), so editing the field during a running hold cannot delete; stale buttons stay blocked by current(). Draft text lives on the mode object (draft.typed) and is rebuilt into the new field on every redraw (3113-3116, 3130-3133); the gated-redraw hold test only deletes via the second button if the text survived. Focus goes to delete-name on open (3186); Escape leaves via leaveMode back to delete:<id> (test added). Field label and comparison use profile.displayName (stored, NFC/trimmed by makeProfile), the title keeps the (2) label. Own-concept/example deletes keep armed=null. Harness auto-typing is limited to an empty, not-yet-autotyped field and opt-out exists; the new tests use typeDeleteName:false.",
